            "rationale": "Keep-kettle is refused; isolate K-2. Serialized reconstruction: cP = k_b * (tau / omega) = 600.00 * (4.00 / 5.00) = 480.00, which is 80.00 cP over the 400.00 isolate floor and 280.00 cP over the 800.00 house-dump tripwire, and Brookfield SNR is 14.0 >= 12.0. Rebound-ratio identity tau/omega = 4.00/5.00 = 0.80; k_b_id identity eta_cP / (tau/omega) = (480.00 - 100.00)/10.00 = 38.00. Missing spindle-zero AE plus Brookveil UTC vs plant UTC+2 skip the zero by 120 min, so Tamsin Pike is not last-to-badge-guilty. Ordered: isolate this dummy kettle; do not refer the tech; Brookveil is not SoT. Scope: this MODIFY does not condemn the mix house (that is a different gate) and does not restart until the 24 min new-spindle floor.",